WEBVTT
Kind: captions
Language: en

00:00:00.123 --> 00:00:02.790
(intense music)

00:00:08.560 --> 00:00:10.740
- Now, why did I just
put my phone on the roof?

00:00:10.740 --> 00:00:13.020
This video is all about
conducting an experiment

00:00:13.020 --> 00:00:15.660
and I need to take every precaution.

00:00:15.660 --> 00:00:17.840
I'm just very, very, very convinced

00:00:17.840 --> 00:00:19.589
that TikTok is spying on me.

00:00:19.589 --> 00:00:22.089
(tense music)

00:00:22.950 --> 00:00:24.440
You're probably picking up on

00:00:24.440 --> 00:00:26.740
a lot of chaotic energy
right now, and that's fair.

00:00:26.740 --> 00:00:28.760
And it's because I'm pretty sure TikTok

00:00:28.760 --> 00:00:30.330
has been spying on me,

00:00:30.330 --> 00:00:32.260
I just have yet to catch TikTok

00:00:32.260 --> 00:00:33.700
in the act of spying on me.

00:00:33.700 --> 00:00:35.970
For the next week, I
am going to be staging

00:00:35.970 --> 00:00:38.290
fake conversations around my phone

00:00:38.290 --> 00:00:41.100
in order to bait TikTok into serving me

00:00:41.100 --> 00:00:43.930
a targeted video on my For You page.

00:00:43.930 --> 00:00:46.100
Should I be having
these fake conversations

00:00:46.100 --> 00:00:47.500
while I'm using TikTok?

00:00:47.500 --> 00:00:49.140
Should I be having these conversations

00:00:49.140 --> 00:00:51.070
while TikTok is open in the background

00:00:51.070 --> 00:00:52.340
but I'm using a different app?

00:00:52.340 --> 00:00:53.780
Should I be having these conversations

00:00:53.780 --> 00:00:55.230
while my phone is just sitting there?

00:00:55.230 --> 00:00:56.320
So in the name of science

00:00:56.320 --> 00:00:57.940
and to just check all the boxes,

00:00:57.940 --> 00:00:58.870
we're gonna do all three.

00:00:58.870 --> 00:01:01.520
While I am using TikTok, the app itself,

00:01:01.520 --> 00:01:04.890
I will be planting the
code word French toast.

00:01:04.890 --> 00:01:06.020
While I'm using my phone

00:01:06.020 --> 00:01:07.800
but TikTok is running in the background,

00:01:07.800 --> 00:01:10.570
I will be planting the code word umbrella.

00:01:10.570 --> 00:01:13.460
And finally, while keeping my
phone in a tight radius of me,

00:01:13.460 --> 00:01:16.603
I will be planting the code word walrus.

00:01:16.603 --> 00:01:17.960
Here we go.

00:01:17.960 --> 00:01:22.910
I want to see either French
toast, umbrella, walrus,

00:01:22.910 --> 00:01:24.883
or God help us, all three.

00:01:25.760 --> 00:01:30.760
I have just been absolutely
craving French toast lately.

00:01:31.070 --> 00:01:32.430
I don't know what they put in it,

00:01:32.430 --> 00:01:35.590
if it was like vanilla extract.

00:01:35.590 --> 00:01:38.450
Which do you think is better,
French toast or pancakes?

00:01:38.450 --> 00:01:39.510
- [Woman] Definitely French toast.

00:01:39.510 --> 00:01:40.343
- I agree!

00:01:40.343 --> 00:01:41.176
All right, so you know,

00:01:41.176 --> 00:01:44.670
just scrolling around Twitter, YouTube.

00:01:44.670 --> 00:01:46.760
I don't remember if it's
gonna rain tomorrow,

00:01:46.760 --> 00:01:48.740
do you know if I'm gonna need an umbrella?

00:01:48.740 --> 00:01:50.140
Like what makes a good umbrella?

00:01:50.140 --> 00:01:53.587
I feel like all the umbrellas
I get are so crappy.

00:01:53.587 --> 00:01:56.530
Have you ever seen a walrus in person?

00:01:56.530 --> 00:01:57.770
- [Woman] Definitely not.

00:01:57.770 --> 00:01:59.290
- You've never seen a walrus?

00:01:59.290 --> 00:02:01.710
Walruses are the ones with the huge tusks

00:02:01.710 --> 00:02:04.000
and the little goatee, right?

00:02:04.000 --> 00:02:06.290
All righty, it is the end of day one.

00:02:06.290 --> 00:02:08.110
We have to check TikTok

00:02:08.110 --> 00:02:12.060
for French toast, umbrella, and walrus.

00:02:12.060 --> 00:02:13.136
Here we go.

00:02:13.136 --> 00:02:15.636
(tense music)

00:02:18.490 --> 00:02:20.200
There was something that resembled

00:02:20.200 --> 00:02:21.907
something similar to French toast

00:02:21.907 --> 00:02:23.696
and I almost had a heart attack.

00:02:23.696 --> 00:02:26.196
(tense music)

00:02:29.552 --> 00:02:33.320
I think we've given the For
You page a fair shot tonight.

00:02:33.320 --> 00:02:34.426
On to day two.

00:02:34.426 --> 00:02:37.093
(intense music)

00:02:38.100 --> 00:02:39.290
Before we get into day two,

00:02:39.290 --> 00:02:40.650
I wanted to make sure I mentioned

00:02:40.650 --> 00:02:42.020
that anytime you see this shot,

00:02:42.020 --> 00:02:43.760
anytime we're having this conversation,

00:02:43.760 --> 00:02:45.220
my phone is on lockdown.

00:02:45.220 --> 00:02:46.970
Just last week I was having a conversation

00:02:46.970 --> 00:02:48.520
about a very specific street food,

00:02:48.520 --> 00:02:51.400
and then days later I got
a TikTok on my For You page

00:02:51.400 --> 00:02:53.000
of that exact street food.

00:02:53.000 --> 00:02:54.490
I'm going to share one more example

00:02:54.490 --> 00:02:56.020
that is a little embarrassing.

00:02:56.020 --> 00:02:58.130
In conversation with my
wife around our apartment,

00:02:58.130 --> 00:03:02.040
I will refer to my stomach as my pooch.

00:03:02.040 --> 00:03:04.320
I'm sharing this because a few
days ago, on my For You page,

00:03:04.320 --> 00:03:07.830
I get a TikTok, how to get
rid of your belly pooch.

00:03:07.830 --> 00:03:09.380
That's why I'm doing this experiment.

00:03:09.380 --> 00:03:10.450
I know it's happening,

00:03:10.450 --> 00:03:13.903
I just need to catch TikTok
in the act of listening to me.

00:03:15.140 --> 00:03:19.220
I think the key to a good
French toast is a good bread.

00:03:19.220 --> 00:03:22.730
I could really go for some French toast.

00:03:22.730 --> 00:03:24.410
Oh man, I really need an umbrella,

00:03:24.410 --> 00:03:26.270
all I've got is my coat.

00:03:26.270 --> 00:03:27.270
That's not gonna cut it.

00:03:27.270 --> 00:03:29.193
I need an umbrella, it's raining.

00:03:30.330 --> 00:03:32.700
I would love to just curl up on the couch

00:03:32.700 --> 00:03:34.850
with a nice big walrus.

00:03:34.850 --> 00:03:38.270
I bet a walrus would love this weather.

00:03:38.270 --> 00:03:40.750
They're in the ocean, they're
in the water all the time.

00:03:40.750 --> 00:03:43.270
A little rain never hurt a walrus.

00:03:43.270 --> 00:03:44.500
We're at the very end of day two,

00:03:44.500 --> 00:03:47.023
gonna look at TikTok one
more time before bed.

00:03:48.325 --> 00:03:50.825
(tense music)

00:03:58.380 --> 00:04:01.452
Day two of the experiment, no luck.

00:04:01.452 --> 00:04:04.119
(intense music)

00:04:05.310 --> 00:04:06.990
Even though this experiment is for a week,

00:04:06.990 --> 00:04:09.160
I really thought we were
gonna be somewhere by now.

00:04:09.160 --> 00:04:11.280
Overall, it's way more draining
than I thought it would be

00:04:11.280 --> 00:04:12.810
of what can I say around my phone?

00:04:12.810 --> 00:04:13.940
What can I say on camera?

00:04:13.940 --> 00:04:15.470
Did I say the wrong thing into the phone?

00:04:15.470 --> 00:04:16.940
Am I saying the right
thing into the camera?

00:04:16.940 --> 00:04:19.080
I just need to see something.

00:04:19.080 --> 00:04:21.390
Day number three of doing
nothing out of the ordinary,

00:04:21.390 --> 00:04:24.450
just talking about my
favorite things out loud

00:04:24.450 --> 00:04:27.029
like I always do, right?

00:04:27.029 --> 00:04:30.420
I really wish I just had someone tell me

00:04:30.420 --> 00:04:31.830
how to make French toast.

00:04:31.830 --> 00:04:32.820
If anyone's listening,

00:04:32.820 --> 00:04:34.390
can you show me how to make French toast?

00:04:34.390 --> 00:04:35.550
To anyone who's listening who thinks

00:04:35.550 --> 00:04:37.874
I'm running out of ways
to talk about umbrellas.

00:04:37.874 --> 00:04:38.707
(scoffing)

00:04:38.707 --> 00:04:40.800
No way, I could talk
about umbrellas all day.

00:04:40.800 --> 00:04:42.400
I just wish I could look at umbrellas.

00:04:42.400 --> 00:04:43.920
The only thing that would
make this day better

00:04:43.920 --> 00:04:45.620
is if I just saw some umbrellas.

00:04:45.620 --> 00:04:46.650
Reply in the comments

00:04:46.650 --> 00:04:49.500
with your number one favorite sea mammal.

00:04:49.500 --> 00:04:51.540
I don't know if a walrus is a sea mammal.

00:04:51.540 --> 00:04:54.150
If I'm wrong, I want someone to correct me

00:04:54.150 --> 00:04:55.630
by showing me a walrus.

00:04:55.630 --> 00:04:57.380
May I have a walrus, please?

00:04:57.380 --> 00:04:59.640
May I please have a walrus?

00:04:59.640 --> 00:05:02.428
We're gonna check TikTok,
see what's going on.

00:05:02.428 --> 00:05:04.928
(tense music)

00:05:13.669 --> 00:05:16.790
I feel like I'm going insane,
because I just got a TikTok

00:05:16.790 --> 00:05:19.140
about how to replace a light on a ceiling.

00:05:19.140 --> 00:05:19.973
Okay?

00:05:19.973 --> 00:05:22.900
And I was at the hardware store yesterday

00:05:22.900 --> 00:05:27.900
getting the tools to replace
the light on the ceiling.

00:05:28.700 --> 00:05:29.765
Help me.

00:05:29.765 --> 00:05:32.693
(intense music)

00:05:32.693 --> 00:05:34.350
(laughing) Where do I start?

00:05:34.350 --> 00:05:36.500
In the midst of shooting this video,

00:05:36.500 --> 00:05:39.170
my wife gets a TikTok about
finding a dress for a wedding.

00:05:39.170 --> 00:05:40.720
I swear on my life,

00:05:40.720 --> 00:05:42.510
days before we were in a vintage store

00:05:42.510 --> 00:05:44.630
talking about dresses for weddings.

00:05:44.630 --> 00:05:45.970
And at the rate things are going,

00:05:45.970 --> 00:05:47.350
I think we have to switch up the words.

00:05:47.350 --> 00:05:48.850
We gotta keep TikTok on its toes.

00:05:48.850 --> 00:05:50.960
While using TikTok, candle.

00:05:50.960 --> 00:05:53.160
While using other apps, eggplant.

00:05:53.160 --> 00:05:55.440
While my phone is nearby, scorpion.

00:05:55.440 --> 00:05:56.325
New words.

00:05:56.325 --> 00:05:59.202
(tense music)

00:05:59.202 --> 00:06:00.640
Every time I look around this bathroom

00:06:00.640 --> 00:06:02.690
I feel like I need a candle.

00:06:02.690 --> 00:06:04.440
I'm also not sure on scent.

00:06:04.440 --> 00:06:07.040
Like is this a eucalyptus vibe in here?

00:06:07.040 --> 00:06:09.830
I don't want to be cocky, but
I've got a nose for candles.

00:06:09.830 --> 00:06:12.190
I've never really picked a bad candle.

00:06:12.190 --> 00:06:15.210
If there's one vegetable
I would love to master,

00:06:15.210 --> 00:06:16.870
it's the eggplant.

00:06:16.870 --> 00:06:18.250
When I go to the store, I don't even know

00:06:18.250 --> 00:06:21.870
if I know how to tell a good
eggplant from a bad eggplant.

00:06:21.870 --> 00:06:26.480
Normally I am not that
bothered by insects,

00:06:26.480 --> 00:06:31.480
but for some reason, scorpions
just don't sit well with me.

00:06:32.200 --> 00:06:33.200
It's the poison.

00:06:33.200 --> 00:06:34.690
It's the pincers.

00:06:34.690 --> 00:06:36.510
I wonder if I should start manifesting

00:06:36.510 --> 00:06:39.400
a scorpion encounter just
to see what I'm made of.

00:06:39.400 --> 00:06:42.332
Time to check TikTok.

00:06:42.332 --> 00:06:44.832
(tense music)

00:06:46.962 --> 00:06:48.105
(sighing) Come on.

00:06:48.105 --> 00:06:50.772
(intense music)

00:06:51.890 --> 00:06:53.140
I'm not even frustrated,

00:06:53.140 --> 00:06:55.340
at this point I'm just mad.

00:06:55.340 --> 00:06:56.760
But that's okay, we gotta keep it moving.

00:06:56.760 --> 00:06:57.690
We need three new words.

00:06:57.690 --> 00:06:59.600
While I'm using TikTok, owl.

00:06:59.600 --> 00:07:01.710
While I'm using other apps, baseball.

00:07:01.710 --> 00:07:04.040
While the phone is nearby, soup.

00:07:04.040 --> 00:07:05.193
Let's just get back to it.

00:07:05.193 --> 00:07:07.161
(tense music)

00:07:07.161 --> 00:07:07.994
Who.

00:07:07.994 --> 00:07:08.930
(laughing)

00:07:08.930 --> 00:07:13.030
That's the sound of one of
my favorite birds, the owl.

00:07:13.030 --> 00:07:15.010
It's a shame that animals are nocturnal

00:07:15.010 --> 00:07:17.970
because I would love to see
owls more during the day,

00:07:17.970 --> 00:07:18.920
if possible.

00:07:18.920 --> 00:07:22.000
Keep your eyes peeled for
the owls in the trees.

00:07:22.000 --> 00:07:23.280
Maybe they're here, maybe they're not.

00:07:23.280 --> 00:07:26.750
Let's be honest, t's a
beautiful day for baseball.

00:07:26.750 --> 00:07:28.140
Anybody think I should just stop

00:07:28.140 --> 00:07:29.590
some random person on the sidewalk

00:07:29.590 --> 00:07:31.180
and ask if they wanna
play baseball with me,

00:07:31.180 --> 00:07:32.630
ask if they wanna have a catch?

00:07:32.630 --> 00:07:35.870
Is baseball one of those sports
I'm just supposed to like?

00:07:35.870 --> 00:07:37.680
Some soup on a warm day.

00:07:37.680 --> 00:07:40.700
I guess there's cold soup,
is that what gazpacho is?

00:07:40.700 --> 00:07:42.790
All this walking, worked
up quite an appetite.

00:07:42.790 --> 00:07:44.960
A big bowl of soup should
help take care of that.

00:07:44.960 --> 00:07:47.500
Is gazpacho a soup even though it's cold?

00:07:47.500 --> 00:07:50.013
Hunting for soup, hunting for soup.

00:07:51.995 --> 00:07:53.640
Phew, here we go.

00:07:53.640 --> 00:07:56.140
(tense music)

00:08:00.156 --> 00:08:00.989
Yes!

00:08:00.989 --> 00:08:02.721
Are you (beep) kidding me?

00:08:02.721 --> 00:08:04.092
(beep)

00:08:04.092 --> 00:08:05.400
Okay, I think we got it.

00:08:05.400 --> 00:08:06.503
That's an owl baby!

00:08:07.906 --> 00:08:08.739
Okay.

00:08:10.010 --> 00:08:11.730
What does this mean?

00:08:11.730 --> 00:08:13.360
While I was using the TikTok app,

00:08:13.360 --> 00:08:15.220
there were so many times where it happened

00:08:15.220 --> 00:08:16.780
but I wasn't able to document it

00:08:16.780 --> 00:08:19.693
and then I finally just
slammed it into TikTok.

00:08:19.693 --> 00:08:21.359
I don't know, I don't know.

00:08:21.359 --> 00:08:22.520
(sighing)

00:08:22.520 --> 00:08:25.300
As satisfying as it was to see that owl,

00:08:25.300 --> 00:08:28.030
can I definitively say the
TikTok was listening to me

00:08:28.030 --> 00:08:29.410
and showed me an owl?

00:08:29.410 --> 00:08:30.500
Maybe.

00:08:30.500 --> 00:08:32.360
Something I thought about
while doing this experiment,

00:08:32.360 --> 00:08:34.530
some of the targeted TikToks
I got were pretty big.

00:08:34.530 --> 00:08:35.470
So maybe it's TikTok

00:08:35.470 --> 00:08:37.810
just funneling viral videos
through their algorithm.

00:08:37.810 --> 00:08:38.970
But then other TikToks

00:08:38.970 --> 00:08:41.310
that were about things
I was speaking about

00:08:41.310 --> 00:08:42.730
that were on the small side,

00:08:42.730 --> 00:08:44.480
it really makes my brain hurt

00:08:44.480 --> 00:08:47.680
in terms of how that lands up in my eyes.

00:08:47.680 --> 00:08:48.930
Will I be going back on TikTok

00:08:48.930 --> 00:08:51.600
for hours on end, day after day?

00:08:51.600 --> 00:08:53.210
I'm gonna try not to.

00:08:53.210 --> 00:08:54.910
Thank you for showing
me what I wanted to see,

00:08:54.910 --> 00:08:56.770
but also not thank you for listening to me

00:08:56.770 --> 00:08:58.616
when I don't want you
to be listening to me.

00:08:58.616 --> 00:09:01.116
(tense music)

